  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AI noise suppression extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. Removes background noise from the captured microphone stream with a neural model, well beyond what the engine's built-in suppressor manages in a noisy room. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.SetAINSMode in the RTC binding.",
